#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:4
msgid "Previewing and Rendering"
msgstr "预览和渲染"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:5
msgid ""
"In order to generate the final animation, including all the transformations and "
"effects applied to the scene elements, the scene has to be *rendered*."
msgstr ""
"为了生成最终的动画，包括应用于场景元素的所有变换和效果，必须对场景进行*渲染*。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:7
msgid ""
"It is also possible to *preview* the animation for performing checks and tune-"
"ups before the full rendering process."
msgstr "还可以在完整渲染过程之前预览动画以进行检查和调整。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:13
msgid "Previewing the Animation"
msgstr "预览动画"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:14
msgid ""
"Animations can be previewed directly in the OpenToonz Viewer, including in the "
"**Preview** mode all the Flipbook features, or by rendering a preview and "
"visualizing it in a separate Flipbook window."
msgstr ""
"动画可以直接在OpenToonz查看器中预览，包括在**预览**模式下预览所有动画书功能，也"
"可以通过渲染预览并在单独的动画书窗口中可视化来预览。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:16
msgid ""
"In both cases the Flipbook window tools can be used, and its appearance can be "
"customized (see  :ref:`Using the Flipbook <using_the_flipbook>`  )."
msgstr ""
"在这两种情况下，都可以使用动画书窗口工具，并且可以自定义其外观（请参阅：ref:“使"
"用动画书<Using_the_Flipbook>”）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:18
msgid ""
"If the computer performance worsens during the preview process of raster "
"animation levels, try activating the **Minimize Raster Memory Fragmentation** "
"option in the Preferences...  →  General dialog section (see  :ref:`Optimizing "
"the Memory Usage <optimizing_the_memory_usage>`  )."
msgstr ""
"如果在光栅动画级别的预览过程中计算机性能恶化，请尝试激活“首选项”中的**最小化光栅"
"内存碎片**选项。..  →  常规对话框部分（请参阅：ref:“优化内存使用"
"<Optimizing_the_Memory_usexuse>”）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:24
msgid "Previewing Frames in the Viewer"
msgstr "在查看器中预览帧"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:25
msgid ""
"In the Viewer it is possible to activate the Preview mode to render the current "
"frame according to the current camera (see  :ref:`Using the Stage Schematic "
"<using_the_stage_schematic>`  for s)."
msgstr ""
"在查看器中，可以激活预览模式，根据当前相机渲染当前帧（请参阅：ref:“使用舞台示意"
"图<Using_the_Stage_Schematic>”for s）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:27
msgid ""
"When changing the current frame, for example by using the playback buttons, it "
"is possible to render other frames of the scene as well. The framebar displays "
"already rendered frames in *dark grey*, frames that have yet to be rendered in "
"*light red*, and the current frame, while being rendered in *light green* and "
"when already rendered in *light grey*."
msgstr ""
"更改当前帧时，例如使用播放按钮，也可以渲染场景的其他帧。框架栏以*深灰色*显示已渲"
"染的帧，以*浅红色*显示尚未渲染的帧以及当前帧，同时以*浅绿色*渲染，并且已以*浅灰"
"色*渲染。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:29
msgid ""
"For the current camera it is also possible to define a **Sub-camera**, having "
"an area smaller than the camera frame, inside which the preview will be "
"rendered, and outside which the scene elements will be displayed as they are."
msgstr ""
"对于当前相机，还可以定义一个**子相机**，其面积小于相机帧，预览将在其内部渲染，场"
"景元素将在其外部按原样显示。对于当前相机，还可以定义一个**子相机**，其面积小于相"
"机帧，预览将在其内部渲染，场景元素将在其外部按原样显示。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:31
msgid ""
"To optimize the preview time, only the area visible in the Viewer will be "
"rendered: if you zoom out the viewer the preview will resume to render the new "
"visualized area."
msgstr ""
"为了优化预览时间，只会渲染查看器中可见的区域：如果缩小查看器，预览将恢复以渲染新"
"的可视化区域。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:33
msgid ""
"When the **Preview mode** is activated, every change made in the scene will "
"cause the preview of frames affected by the changes to be recomputed. If, for "
"some reason, the preview fails during the update process, you can regenerate "
"the preview, which will automatically delete previously previewed frames, and "
"compute them again."
msgstr ""
"当**预览模式**被激活时，场景中的每一个更改都会导致重新计算受更改影响的帧的预览。"
"如果由于某种原因，在更新过程中预览失败，您可以重新生成预览，这将自动删除以前预览"
"的帧，并重新计算它们。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:35
msgid "Once the frames are previewed, the results can be saved to disk."
msgstr "预览帧后，可以将结果保存到磁盘。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:37
msgid ""
"The background colors of the preview window, including the colors of the camera "
"background, the window background and the checkerboard visible when transparent "
"images are rendered, are those defined for the Flipbook (see  :ref:`Using the "
"Flipbook <using_the_flipbook>`  )."
msgstr ""
"预览窗口的背景颜色，包括渲染透明图像时可见的相机背景、窗口背景和棋盘的颜色，是为"
"动画书定义的颜色（请参阅：ref:“使用动画书<Using_The_Flipbook>”）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:39
msgid ""
"When previewing frames in the Viewer it is possible to display blank frames "
"after each preview playback, when looping (see  :ref:`Using the Flipbook "
"<using_the_flipbook>`  ), and to limit the range of frames to be considered "
"when playing back the animation by using the **Playback Markers** (see  :ref:"
"`Using the Playback Markers <using_the_playback_markers>`  )."
msgstr ""
"在查看器中预览帧时，可以在每次预览播放后、循环播放时显示空白帧（请参阅：ref:“使"
"用动画书<Using_the_Flipbook>”），并使用**播放标记**限制播放动画时要考虑的帧范围"
"（请参阅；ref:“使用播放标记<Using_the_playback_Markers>”）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:41
msgid ""
"The Camera Box, the Field Guide, the Safe Area and the Guides can be shown or "
"hidden in the Viewer during Preview as well (see  :ref:`Customizing the Viewer "
"<customizing_the_work_area>`  )."
msgstr ""
"在预览期间，也可以在查看器中显示或隐藏相机盒、现场指南、安全区和指南（请参阅："
"ref:`自定义查看器<Customizing_The_work_Area>`）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:43
msgid ""
"If the **Apply Shrink to Main Viewer** option is activated in the Preview "
"Settings dialog, the previewed frames may have a reduced resolution (see  :ref:"
"`Using the Preview Window <using_the_preview_window>`  )."
msgstr ""
"如果在“预览设置”对话框中激活了**将收缩应用于主查看器**选项，则预览帧的分辨率可能"
"会降低（请参阅：ref:“使用预览窗口<Using_the_Preview_Window>”）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:45
msgid "**To activate and deactivate the preview:**"
msgstr "**要激活和停用预览，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:47
msgid ""
"Click the **Preview** button (|preview|) in the viewer title bar to activate or "
"deactivate the *Preview mode*."
msgstr "单击查看器标题栏中的**预览**按钮（|Preview|）以激活或停用*预览模式*。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:49
msgid "**To define a preview Sub-camera for the current camera:**"
msgstr "**要为当前摄影机定义预览子摄影机，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:51
msgid ""
"Activate the **Define Sub-camera** button (|define_preview_subcamera|) in the "
"viewer bottom bar."
msgstr "激活查看器底部栏中的**定义子摄像头**按钮（|Define_preview_subcamera|）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:53
msgid ""
"Click and drag in the Viewer to define the box for the *Sub-camera area*; once "
"the box is defined you can resize it by clicking and dragging its sides and "
"corners, and move it by clicking and dragging inside of it."
msgstr ""
"在查看器中单击并拖动以定义*子相机区域*的框；定义好框后，您可以通过单击并拖动其边"
"和角来调整其大小，并通过在框内单击并拖动来移动它。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:55
msgid "**To hide the Sub-camera box:**"
msgstr "**要隐藏“子摄影机”框，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:57
msgid ""
"Deactivate the **Define Sub-camera** button (|define_preview_subcamera|) in the "
"Viewer bottom bar."
msgstr "停用查看器底部栏中的**定义子摄像头**按钮（|Define_preview_subcamera|）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:59
msgid "**To activate and deactivate the Sub-camera preview:**"
msgstr "**要激活和停用子摄影机预览，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:61
msgid ""
"Click the **Sub-camera Preview** button (|subcamera_preview|) in the Viewer "
"title bar to activate or deactivate the *Sub-camera Preview mode*."
msgstr ""
"单击查看器标题栏中的**子相机预览**按钮（|subcamera_Preview|）以激活或停用*子相机"
"预览模式*。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:63
msgid "**To regenerate the preview:**"
msgstr "**要重新生成预览，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:65
msgid ""
"Right-click in the viewer in *Preview mode* and choose from the menu that opens "
"one of the following:"
msgstr "在*预览模式*的查看器中右键单击，然后从打开以下菜单之一的菜单中选择："

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:67
msgid ""
"**Regenerate Frame Preview** to delete and recompute the current frame only."
msgstr "**重新生成帧预览**以仅删除和重新计算当前帧。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:69
msgid ""
"**Regenerate Preview** to delete and recompute the whole previewed frame range."
msgstr "**重新生成预览**以删除并重新计算整个预览帧范围。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:71
msgid "**To save previewed frames:**"
msgstr "**要保存预览的帧，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:73
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:243
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:255
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:281
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:295
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:313
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:351
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:363
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:686
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:696
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:781
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:805
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:813
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:821
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:829
msgid "Do one of the following:"
msgstr "执行以下操作之一："

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:75
msgid "Click the **Save Images** button (|save|) in the Viewer bottom bar."
msgstr "单击查看器底部栏中的**保存图像**按钮（|Save|）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:77
msgid ""
"Right-click in the Viewer, and choose **Save Previewed Frames** from the menu "
"that opens."
msgstr "在查看器中右键单击，然后从打开的菜单中选择**保存预览帧**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:79
msgid "Use the Browser to choose a name and location for the file to be saved."
msgstr "使用浏览器为要保存的文件选择名称和位置。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:81
msgid ""
"The saved files format will be the one currently defined in the **Output "
"Settings** dialog, and the format options used at save time will also be the "
"ones defined by using the **Options** button there (see  :ref:`Choosing the "
"Output Settings <choosing_the_output_settings>`  )."
msgstr ""
"保存的文件格式将是当前在**输出设置**对话框中定义的格式，保存时使用的格式选项也将"
"是使用那里的**选项**按钮定义的格式选项（请参阅：ref:`选择输出设置"
"<Choosing_The_Output_Settings>`）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:83
msgid ""
"The saved files *color depth* will always be 8 bit, regardless of the options "
"chosen in the Output Settings or Preview Settings dialogs."
msgstr ""
"保存的文件格式将是当前在**输出设置**对话框中定义的格式，保存时使用的格式选项也将"
"是使用那里的**选项**按钮定义的格式选项（请参阅：ref:`选择输出设置"
"<Choosing_The_Output_Settings>`）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:89
msgid "Using the Preview Window"
msgstr "使用预览窗口"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:90
msgid ""
"The animation can be previewed in a separate window according to specific "
"*Preview Settings*, that can be different from the *Output Settings*. In this "
"way the preview can be configured so that it is faster to compute then the "
"final output, for example because it uses a camera with a smaller resolution."
msgstr ""
"可以根据特定的“预览设置”在单独的窗口中预览动画，该设置可能与“输出设置”不同。通过"
"这种方式，可以配置预览，使其计算速度比最终输出更快，例如，因为它使用了分辨率较小"
"的相机。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:92
msgid ""
"It is possible to define the range of previewed frames both in the Preview "
"Settings and by using the Playback Markers in the Xsheet/Timeline: any change "
"made in one mode is reflected in the other one as well (see  :ref:`Using the "
"Playback Markers <using_the_playback_markers>`  ). It is also possible to "
"display blank frames after each preview playback, when looping."
msgstr ""
"可以在预览设置中定义预览帧的范围，也可以使用Xsheet/Timeline中的播放标记来定义："
"在一种模式下所做的任何更改也会反映在另一种模式中（请参阅：ref:`使用播放标记"
"<using_the_Playback_Markers>'）。循环时，也可以在每次预览播放后显示空白帧。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:94
msgid ""
"It is possible to activate the Preferences...  →  Preview  →  **Fit to "
"Flipbook** option to ensure that the previewed images fit the size of the "
"preview window, regardless their resolution."
msgstr ""
"可以激活首选项。..  →  预览→  **“适合动画书”**选项，以确保预览的图像适合预览窗口"
"的大小，而不管其分辨率如何。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:96
msgid ""
"It is possible to clone the Preview window, or to automatically open as many "
"Preview windows as needed by activating the Preferences...  →  Preview  →  "
"**Display in a New Flipbook Window** option, for example to examine or compare "
"specific frames by using the Flipbook tools (see  :ref:`Using the Flipbook "
"<using_the_flipbook>` )."
msgstr ""
"可以克隆预览窗口，或通过激活首选项自动打开所需数量的预览窗口。..  →  预览→  **"
"在“新动画书窗口”**选项中显示，例如使用动画书工具检查或比较特定帧（请参阅："
"ref:“使用动画书<using_the_Flipbook>”）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:98
msgid "|preview_settings_dialog|"
msgstr "|预览设置对话框|"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:100
msgid ""
"As when changes are made in the scene all the preview windows automatically "
"update, it is possible to check the animation before and after some editing by "
"freezing any of the Previews."
msgstr ""
"当在场景中进行更改时，所有预览窗口都会自动更新，因此可以通过冻结任何预览来检查编"
"辑前后的动画。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:102
msgid ""
"The Preview window framebar displays rendered frames in *grey*, frames that "
"have yet to be rendered in *light red*, and the current frame that is being "
"rendered in *light green*."
msgstr ""
"“预览”窗口框架栏以*灰色*显示渲染帧，以*浅红色*显示尚未渲染的帧，并以*浅绿色*显示"
"正在渲染的当前帧。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:104
msgid ""
"To optimize the preview time, only the area visible in the Preview window will "
"be rendered: if you zoom out the Viewer the preview will resume to render the "
"new visualized area."
msgstr ""
"为了优化预览时间，只会渲染预览窗口中可见的区域：如果缩小查看器，预览将恢复以渲染"
"新的可视化区域。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:106
msgid ""
"The Preview Settings dialog lets you define the resolution, range, step and "
"shrink of the preview frames. Settings are the following:"
msgstr "“预览设置”对话框允许您定义预览帧的分辨率、范围、步长和收缩。设置如下："

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:108
msgid ""
"**Output Camera:** sets which camera, among the ones defined in the scene, has "
"to be used to set the resolution and preview the animation."
msgstr ""
"**输出摄影机：**设置场景中定义的摄影机中必须用于设置分辨率和预览动画的摄影机。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:110
msgid ""
"**Frame Start:** and **End:** set the frame range of the scene to preview; by "
"default these values refer to the whole scene length."
msgstr ""
"**帧开始：**和**结束：**设置要预览的场景的帧范围；默认情况下，这些值指的是整个场"
"景的长度。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:112
msgid ""
"**Step:** sets the step for the rendered sequence; for example if it is two, "
"one frame each two will be rendered."
msgstr "**步骤：**设置渲染序列的步骤；例如，如果是两帧，则每两帧渲染一帧。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:114
msgid ""
"**Shrink:** sets the reduction value for the previewed sequence resolution; for "
"example if it is 2, one pixel each two will be rendered, thus resulting in "
"previewed frames having half of the original output camera resolution."
msgstr ""
"**收缩：**设置预览序列分辨率的缩减值；例如，如果它是2，则每两个像素将渲染一个像"
"素，从而导致预览帧具有原始输出相机分辨率的一半。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:116
msgid ""
"**Apply Shrink to Main Viewer** if activated uses the shrink value set in the "
"preview settings to the preview mode of the viewer as well (see  :ref:"
"`Previewing Frames in the Viewer <previewing_frames_in_the_viewer>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**如果激活，将收缩应用于主查看器**也会将预览设置中设置的收缩值应用于查看器的预览"
"模式（请参阅：ref:`查看器中的预览帧<Previewing_Frames_inthe_Viewer>`）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:118
msgid ""
"**Resample Balance:** controls the resample that is used when images are scaled "
"or rotated. In scenes where images are strongly resampled, for instance when "
"their size changes dramatically, the final rendering may appear slightly out of "
"focus. By balancing the resample you can give some sharpness back to the "
"rendered frames."
msgstr ""
"**重采样平衡：**控制图像缩放或旋转时使用的重采样。在图像被强烈重采样的场景中，例"
"如当它们的大小发生巨大变化时，最终渲染可能会出现轻微失焦。通过平衡重采样，您可以"
"为渲染帧提供一些锐度。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:120
msgid ""
"There are several options to choose from. Originally *Toonz* provided three "
"options: **Standard**, **Improved**, **High**. The higher the balance chosen, "
"the longer the time needed for rendering the output. Additionally, *OpenToonz* "
"provides several other standard resampling filters that could help improve the "
"final results in a wider range of situations."
msgstr ""
"有几个选项可供选择。最初，*图恩斯*提供了三个选项：**标准**、**改进**、**高**。选"
"择的平衡值越高，渲染输出所需的时间就越长。此外，*OpenToonz*还提供了其他几个标准"
"重采样过滤器，可以在更广泛的情况下帮助改进最终结果。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:123
msgid ""
"**Channel Width:** sets the color depth for rendered images; choices are 8 bit "
"or 16 bit per color channel."
msgstr "**通道宽度：**设置渲染图像的颜色深度；每个颜色通道的选择是8位或16位。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:125
msgid ""
"**Dedicated CPUs:** sets, in case your computer has multiple CPUs, how many "
"processors will be assigned to the previewing process. Setting the value to All "
"will generate a number of rendering threads equal to the number of processors, "
"thus speeding up the previewing process. However it is suggested to use the "
"Half or Single values if the scene to preview is very complex, because the "
"higher the dedicated CPUs, the more the memory required to perform the preview."
msgstr ""
"**专用CPU：**设置，如果您的计算机有多个CPU，将为预览过程分配多少个处理器。将该值"
"设置为“全部”将生成与处理器数量相等的渲染线程数量，从而加快预览过程。但是，如果要"
"预览的场景非常复杂，建议使用半值或单值，因为专用CPU越高，执行预览所需的内存就越"
"多。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:127
msgid ""
"**Render Tile:** allows the preview of very complex scenes whose frames will be "
"computed in tiles that are automatically stitched to create the final preview: "
"the smaller the size of the tile, the longer the preview process. Setting the "
"value to Medium or Small will allow the preview of very high resolution outputs "
"of very complex scenes, that otherwise may fail to be previewed; setting the "
"value to None may prevent some artifacts that the tile stitching may generate. "
"In most of the cases the Large value will do the work, because it is not slower "
"than the None option, and yet is able to preview complex scenes."
msgstr ""
"**专用CPU：**设置，如果您的计算机有多个CPU，将为预览过程分配多少个处理器。将该值"
"设置为“全部”将生成与处理器数量相等的渲染线程数量，从而加快预览过程。但是，如果要"
"预览的场景非常复杂，建议使用半值或单值，因为专用CPU越高，执行预览所需的内存就越"
"多。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:129
msgid ""
"**Use Sub-camera**, when activated, uses the sub-camera defined for the "
"selected camera in the preview frames (see  :ref:`Previewing Frames in the "
"Viewer <previewing_frames_in_the_viewer>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**使用子相机**，激活后，使用为预览帧中选定相机定义的子相机（请参阅：ref:`查看器"
"中的预览帧<Previewing_frames_inthe_Viewer>`）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:132
msgid "**To set the scene preview settings:**"
msgstr "**要设置场景预览设置，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:134
