msgstr "设置要用于预览的选项。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:138
msgid "**To open the preview window:**"
msgstr "**要打开预览窗口，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:140
msgid "Choose Render  →  **Preview**."
msgstr "选择渲染→  **预览**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:142
msgid "**To clone the preview window:**"
msgstr "**要克隆预览窗口，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:144
msgid ""
"Right-click in the Flipbook window and choose **Clone Preview** from the menu "
"that opens."
msgstr "在“动画书”窗口中单击鼠标右键，然后从打开的菜单中选择**克隆预览**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:146
msgid "**To freeze the preview rendering:**"
msgstr "**要冻结预览渲染，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:148
msgid ""
"Right-click in the Flipbook window and choose **Freeze Preview** from the menu "
"that opens."
msgstr "在“动画书”窗口中单击鼠标右键，然后从打开的菜单中选择**冻结预览**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:150
msgid "**To open a new Flipbook window every time you run a preview:**"
msgstr "**要在每次运行预览时打开新的动画书窗口，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:152
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:158
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:164
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:289
msgid "In File  →  Preferences...  →  Preview."
msgstr "在文件中→  偏好。..  →  预览。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:154
msgid "Activate the **Display in a New Flipbook Window** option."
msgstr "激活**在新动画书窗口中显示**选项。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:156
msgid "**To rewind the preview content automatically after playback:**"
