#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:160
msgid "Activate the **Rewind After Playback** option."
msgstr "激活**播放后回放**选项。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:162
msgid "**To display blank frames after each preview playback when looping:**"
msgstr "*要在循环时每次预览播放后显示空白帧，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:166
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:663
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:706
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:795
msgid "Do any of the following:"
msgstr "执行以下任一操作："

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:168
msgid ""
"Use **Blank Frames** option to set how many blank frames you want to be "
"displayed after each preview playback, when looping."
msgstr "使用**空白帧**选项设置循环时每次预览播放后要显示多少空白帧。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:170
msgid "Use **Blank Frames Color** option to set the color for the blank frames."
msgstr "使用**空白帧颜色**选项设置空白帧的颜色。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:176
msgid "Previewing and Caching Effect Nodes in the Schematic"
msgstr "预览和缓存示意图中的效果节点"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:177
msgid ""
"The Preview window can also be opened from the FX Schematic, to check the "
"compositing result up to a specific node. The behaviour of the FX Schematic "
"Preview window is the same as the standard one (see  :ref:`Using the Preview "
"Window <using_the_preview_window>`  )."
msgstr ""
"预览窗口也可以从FX原理图打开，以检查特定节点的合成结果。FX原理图预览窗口的行为与"
"标准窗口相同（参见：ref:“使用预览窗口<Using_The_Preview_window>”）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:179
msgid ""
"In case the Sub-camera is used, the Preview window will fit the Sub-camera area "
"(see  :ref:`Using the Preview Window <using_the_preview_window>`  )."
msgstr ""
"如果使用了子相机，预览窗口将适合子相机区域（请参阅：ref:“使用预览窗口"
"<Using_the_Preview_window>”）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:181
msgid ""
"It is also possible to cache the preview up to a specific node, so that the "
"result of the compositing up to that node is stored in the computer memory and "
"will be reused with no need to recompute it the next time the preview is run."
msgstr ""
"还可以将预览缓存到特定节点，以便将该节点的合成结果存储在计算机内存中，并在下次运"
"行预览时重复使用，而无需重新计算。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:183
msgid ""
"Of course if something changes in the flow up to the cached node (for example "
"if an object transformation or an effect parameter is changed), the cached "
"preview will be discarded and will be stored again the next time the Preview is "
"run."
msgstr ""
"当然，如果缓存节点的流中发生了变化（例如，如果对象变换或效果参数发生了变化），缓"
"存的预览将被丢弃，并在下次运行预览时再次存储。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:185
msgid "**To open a Preview window referring to an FX Schematic node:**"
msgstr "**要打开参照FX原理图节点的预览窗口，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:187
msgid "Right-click the node and choose **Preview** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击节点，然后从打开的菜单中选择**预览**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:189
msgid "**To cache an effect node:**"
msgstr "**要缓存效果节点，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:191
msgid ""
"Right-click the node and choose **Cache FX** from the menu that opens: the "
"effect node will be displayed with a fold at the bottom right corner to "
"highlight that it has been cached."
msgstr ""
"右键单击节点，然后从打开的菜单中选择**缓存FX**：效果节点将在右下角显示一个折叠，"
"以突出显示它已被缓存。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:193
msgid "**To uncache an effect node:**"
msgstr "**要取消缓存效果节点，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:195
msgid ""
"Right-click the node and choose **Cache FX** from the menu that opens: the "
"cached preview images will be discarded."
msgstr "右键单击节点，然后从打开的菜单中选择**缓存FX**：缓存的预览图像将被丢弃。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:201
msgid "Using the Flipbook"
msgstr "使用动画书"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:202
msgid ""
"The Flipbook is an image viewer where animation levels, images, clips and "
"rendered frames can be displayed. In OpenToonz it is used to display the scene "
"contents in the Viewer, including the Preview mode, and to display the "
"previewed or rendered animations. It is also used to view files and levels from "
"the browser or the Xsheet/Timeline, and to display the loaded Color Model."
msgstr ""
"动画书是一个图像查看器，可以显示动画级别、图像、剪辑和渲染帧。在OpenToonz中，它"
"用于在查看器中显示场景内容，包括预览模式，并显示预览或渲染的动画。它还用于从浏览"
"器或Xsheet/Timeline查看文件和级别，并显示加载的颜色模型。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:204
msgid ""
"The Safe Area is the only element that can be shown or hidden in the Flipbook "
"when previewing the animation (see  :ref:`Customizing the Viewer "
"<customizing_the_work_area>`  )."
msgstr ""
"安全区域是预览动画时动画书中唯一可以显示或隐藏的元素（请参阅：ref:`自定义查看器"
"<Customizing_The_work_Area>`）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:206
msgid ""
"The Flipbook title bar displays the information about the content on the left, "
"and the zoom percentage on the right."
msgstr "动画书标题栏左侧显示有关内容的信息，右侧显示缩放百分比。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:208
msgid "At the bottom a customizable set of buttons is available:"
msgstr "动画书标题栏左侧显示有关内容的信息，右侧显示缩放百分比。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:210
msgid ""
"The **Option** button (|option|) sets which buttons and elements have to be "
"displayed in the bottom bar."
msgstr "**选项**按钮（|Option|）设置必须在底部栏中显示的按钮和元素。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:212
msgid ""
"The **Save Images** button (|save|) opens a browser to save the flipbook "
"content."
msgstr "**保存图像**按钮（|Save|）打开浏览器以保存翻页书内容。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:214
msgid ""
"The **Snapshot** (|snapshot|) and **Compare to Snapshot** (|compare|) buttons "
"allow the comparison between different frames of the flipbook content."
msgstr ""
"**快照**（|Snapshot |）和**与快照比较**（|Compare|）按钮允许对翻页书内容的不同帧"
"进行比较。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:216
msgid ""
"The **Define Sub-camera** button (|define_preview_subcamera|) allows the "
"definition of a region, smaller than the size of the loaded image sequence, "
"that will limit the portion of the images that will be displayed in the "
"Flipbook. It may prove useful to speed up the loading time and increase the "
"playback speed, when you are only interested in a certain region of the full "
"camera image."
msgstr ""
"**定义子相机**按钮（|Define_preview_subcamera|）允许定义一个小于加载图像序列大小"
"的区域，该区域将限制动画书中显示的图像部分。当您只对全相机图像的某个区域感兴趣"
"时，加快加载时间和提高播放速度可能会很有用。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:218
msgid ""
"The **Sub-camera Preview** button (|subcamera_preview|) lets you activate or "
"deactivate the defined sub-camera region (see above)."
msgstr ""
"**子摄影机预览**按钮（|subcamera_Preview|）允许您激活或停用已定义的子摄影机区域"
"（见上文）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:220
msgid ""
"The **Background** color buttons sets a **White** (|preview_white|), **Black** "
"(|preview_black|) or **Checkered** (|preview_checkboard|) background for "
"transparent images."
msgstr ""
"**背景**颜色按钮为透明图像设置**白色**（|preview_White|）、**黑色**（|"
"preview_Black|）或**格子**（|review_checkboard|）背景。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:222
msgid ""
"The framerate slider sets the number of frames per second to be displayed "
"during playback."
msgstr "帧率滑块设置播放期间每秒显示的帧数。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:224
msgid ""
"The playback buttons can be used to play the Flipbook content back and set the "
"current frame."
msgstr "播放按钮可用于播放动画书内容并设置当前帧。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:226
msgid ""
"The **Channel** buttons display the Red, Green, Blue and Alpha channels of the "
"Flipbook content, both in *colors* and *grey-scale*."
msgstr "**频道**按钮以*颜色*和*灰度*显示动画书内容的红色、绿色、蓝色和Alpha频道。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:228
msgid ""
"The **Histogram** button (|histogram|) opens a window displaying histograms "
"mapping the amount of the darkest and lightest pixels in each channel."
msgstr ""
"**直方图**按钮（|直方图|）打开一个窗口，显示映射每个通道中最暗和最亮像素数量的直"
"方图。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:230
msgid ""
"If the bottom bar is too short to display all the options, it can be scrolled "
"by using arrow buttons available at its ends."
msgstr "如果底部栏太短，无法显示所有选项，可以使用其末端的箭头按钮进行滚动。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:233
msgid ""
"In an opened Flipbook it is possible to load new contents both replacing the "
"previous animation, or appending the new contents to it. When several Flipbooks "
"are opened, their playback can be *linked*, so that moving the current frame or "
"playing the contents back in one of them, automatically moves the current "
"frames and plays the contents back in *all* the other Flipbooks as well."
msgstr ""
"在打开的动画书中，可以加载新内容，既可以替换之前的动画，也可以将新内容附加到其"
"中。当打开多个动画书时，可以*链接*它们的播放，这样移动当前帧或在其中一个中播放内"
"容，会自动移动当前帧，并在*所有*其他动画书中播放内容。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:235
msgid ""
"The colors displayed as background in the flipbook can also be customized so "
"that they can better fit the color scheme of the production."
msgstr "动画书中显示为背景的颜色也可以定制，以便更好地适应制作的配色方案。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:237
msgid "**To open a Flipbook:**"
msgstr "**要打开动画书，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:239
msgid "Choose Windows  →  **Flipbook**."
msgstr "选择Windows→  **动画书**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:241
msgid "**To load some contents into a Flipbook:**"
msgstr "**要将某些内容加载到动画书中，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:245
msgid ""
"Right-click in the Flipbook and choose **Load Images** from the menu that "
"opens, then use the Browser to retrieve the file you want to load."
msgstr ""
"在动画书中单击鼠标右键，从打开的菜单中选择**加载图像**，然后使用浏览器检索要加载"
"的文件。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:247
msgid ""
"Drag and drop the file you want to load from the OpenToonz file browser to the "
"Flipbook."
msgstr "将要从OpenToonz文件浏览器加载的文件拖放到动画书中。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:249
msgid "**To append some content to the Flipbook content:**"
msgstr "**要将某些内容附加到动画书内容中，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:251
msgid ""
"Right-click in the Flipbook and choose **Append Images** from the menu that "
"opens, then use the Browser to retrieve the file you want to append to the "
"current content."
msgstr ""
"在动画书中单击鼠标右键，从打开的菜单中选择**附加图像**，然后使用浏览器检索要附加"
"到当前内容的文件。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:253
msgid "**To navigate the Flipbook content:**"
msgstr "**要浏览动画书内容，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:257
msgid ""
"Use the zoom shortcut keys (by default **+** and **-** keys) to zoom in and "
"zoom out at specific steps (e.g. 50%, 100%, 200%, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"使用缩放快捷键（默认情况下为**+**和**-**键）按特定步骤（例如50%、100%、200%等）"
"放大和缩小。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:259
msgid "Use the mouse wheel to zoom in and zoom out."
msgstr "使用鼠标滚轮放大和缩小。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:261
msgid "Click and drag to define an area you want to zoom to."
msgstr "单击并拖动以定义要缩放的区域。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:263
msgid ""
"Use the Reset View shortcut (by default the **Alt + 0** key), or right-click in "
"the Viewer and choose **Reset View** from the menu that opens, to display the "
"Flipbook content at its actual size, and centered on the image center."
msgstr ""
"使用“重置视图”快捷方式（默认情况下为**Alt+0**键），或在查看器中单击鼠标右键，然"
"后从打开的菜单中选择**重置视图**，以实际大小显示动画书内容，并居中显示在图像中"
"心。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:265
msgid "Middle-click and drag to scroll in any direction."
msgstr "单击鼠标中键并拖动可向任何方向滚动。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:267
msgid "**To fit the size of the Flipbook window to its content:**"
msgstr "**要使动画书窗口的大小与其内容相匹配，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:269
msgid "Double-click the Flipbook title bar."
msgstr "双击动画书标题栏。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:271
msgid "**Windows only - to enter/exit the Flipbook full screen mode:**"
msgstr "**仅限Windows-进入/退出动画书全屏模式：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:273
msgid ""
"Right-click the Flipbook and choose **Full Screen Mode** / **Exit Full Screen "
"Mode** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击动画书，然后从打开的菜单中选择**全屏模式**/**退出全屏模式**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:275
msgid "**To customize the Flipbook bottom bar:**"
msgstr "**要自定义动画书底部栏，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:277
msgid ""
"Use the **Option** button (|option|) to choose which buttons and elements have "
"to be displayed: only selected items will be displayed."
msgstr "使用**选项**按钮（|选项|）选择必须显示的按钮和元素：只显示选定的项目。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:279
msgid "**To play the Flipbook content back:**"
msgstr "**要播放动画书内容，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:283
msgid "Use the **Play** button."
msgstr "使用**播放**按钮。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:285
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:299
msgid "Drag the frame bar cursor."
msgstr "拖动框架栏光标。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:287
msgid "**To rewind the Flipbook content automatically after playback:**"
msgstr "**要在播放后自动倒带动画书内容，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:291
msgid "Activate the **Rewind after Playback** option."
msgstr "激活**播放后回放**选项。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:293
msgid "**To set the current frame:**"
msgstr "**要设置当前帧，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:297
msgid "Use the playback buttons."
msgstr "使用播放按钮。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:301
msgid "Type in the frame bar field the number of the frame you want to view."
msgstr "在框架栏字段中键入要查看的框架编号。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:303
msgid "**To link the playback of all the open Flipbook windows:**"
msgstr "**要链接所有打开的动画书窗口的播放，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:305
msgid ""
"Choose Play  →  **Link Flipbooks** to activate or deactivate the linked "
"playback mode."
msgstr "选择播放→  **链接动画书**以激活或停用链接播放模式。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:307
msgid "**To set the playback frame rate:**"
msgstr "**要设置播放帧率，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:309
msgid ""
"Use the frame rate slider; by default the framerate is the one set in the "
"**Scene Settings** dialog (see  :ref:`Setting the Frame Rate "
"<setting_the_frame_rate>`  )."
msgstr ""
"使用帧率滑块；默认情况下，帧速率是在**场景设置**对话框中设置的帧速率（请参阅："
"ref:`设置帧速率<Setting_the_Frame_Rate>`）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:311
msgid "**To save the Flipbook content:**"
msgstr "**要保存动画书内容，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:315
msgid ""
"Right-click in the Flipbook and choose **Save Images** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "在动画书中单击鼠标右键，然后从打开的菜单中选择**保存图像**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:317
msgid "Click the **Save Images** button (|save|) in the Flipbook bottom bar."
msgstr "单击动画书底部栏中的**保存图像**按钮（|Save|）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:319
msgid ""
"Use the Browser to choose a name, a format and a location for the file to be "
"saved."
msgstr "使用浏览器为要保存的文件选择名称、格式和位置。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:321
msgid "**To take a snapshot of a frame and compare it to another frame:**"
msgstr "**要拍摄一帧的快照并将其与另一帧进行比较，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:323
msgid ""
"Select the frame you want to store and click the **Snapshot** button (|"
"snapshot|) in the Flipbook bottom bar."
msgstr "选择要存储的帧，然后单击动画书底部栏中的**快照**按钮（|Snapshot|）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:325
msgid ""
"Move to a different frame, or load some different content, and click the "
"**Compare to Snapshot** button (|compare|)."
msgstr ""
"移动到其他帧，或加载一些不同的内容，然后单击**与快照比较**按钮（|比较|）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:327
msgid ""
"Click and drag the vertical or horizontal marker to display the taken snapshot "
"under the current frame."
msgstr "单击并拖动垂直或水平标记，以显示当前帧下拍摄的快照。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:329
msgid ""
"Click again the **Compare to Snapshot** button (|compare|) to exit the compare "
"mode."
msgstr "再次单击**与快照比较**按钮（|Compare|）退出比较模式。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:331
msgid "**To Define the Loading Box:**"
msgstr "**要定义装载箱，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:333
msgid "Load in the Flipbook the sequence of images you want to visualize."
msgstr "在动画书中加载要可视化的图像序列。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:335
msgid ""
"Activate the **Define Loading Box** button (|define_preview_subcamera|) in the "
"Flipbook bottom bar."
msgstr "激活动画书底部栏中的**定义加载框**按钮（|Define_preview_subcamera|）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:337
msgid ""
"Click and drag in the image to Define the Loading Box; once the box is defined "
"you can resize it by clicking and dragging its sides and corners, and move it "
"by clicking and dragging inside it."
msgstr ""
"在图像中单击并拖动以定义加载框；定义框后，您可以通过单击并拖动其边和角来调整其大"
"小，并通过在其中单击并拖动来移动它。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:339
msgid "**To activate and deactivate the Loading Box:**"
msgstr "**要激活和停用装载箱：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:341
msgid ""
"Click the **Use Loading Box** button (|subcamera_preview|) in the Flipbook "
"bottombar to activate or deactivate the loading box."
msgstr ""
"单击动画书底部栏中的**使用加载框**按钮（|subcamera_preview|）以激活或停用加载"
"框。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:343
msgid "**To set the Flipbook background color for transparent images:**"
msgstr "**要设置透明图像的动画书背景颜色，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:345
msgid ""
"Click the **White Background** (|preview_white|), **Black Background** (|"
"preview_black|) or **Checkered Background** (|preview_checkboard|) buttons in "
"the Flipbook bottom bar to activate/deactivate the desired background color."
msgstr ""
"单击动画书底部栏中的**白色背景**（|preview_White|）、**黑色背景**（|| "
"preview_Black|）或**格子背景**（| preview_checkboard|）按钮，以激活/停用所需的背"
"景颜色。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:347
msgid ""
"In the Preview window and when the Viewer is in *Preview mode* the background "
"color will be visible behind the *Camera BG Color* (see below )."
msgstr ""
"在预览窗口中，当查看器处于*预览模式*时，背景颜色将显示在*相机BG颜色*后面（见下"
"文）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:349
msgid "**To set the image channels to be displayed:**"
msgstr "**要设置要显示的图像通道，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:353
msgid ""
"Click the top section of the **Red**, **Green** and **Blue** buttons in the "
"Flipbook bottom bar to display, or hide, the related *image channel* in colors."
msgstr ""
"单击动画书底部栏中**红色**、**绿色**和**蓝色**按钮的顶部，以彩色显示或隐藏相关的"
"*图像通道*。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:355
msgid ""
"Click *the bottom* section of the **Red**, **Green** and **Blue** buttons in "
"the Flipbook bottom bar to display, or hide, the related *image channel* in "
"grey-scale."
msgstr ""
"单击动画书底部栏中**红色**、**绿色**和**蓝色**按钮的*底部*部分，以灰度显示或隐藏"
"相关的*图像通道*。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:357
msgid ""
"Click the **Alpha Channel** button in the Flipbook bottom bar to display, or "
"hide, the image alpha channel."
msgstr "单击动画书底部栏中的**Alpha通道**按钮以显示或隐藏图像Alpha通道。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:359
msgid "When no channel button is activated the full image is displayed."
msgstr "当没有激活频道按钮时，将显示完整图像。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:361
msgid "**To display the Histograms of the Flipbook content:**"
msgstr "**要显示动画书内容的直方图，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:365
msgid "Click the **Histogram** button (|histogram|) in the Flipbook bottom bar."
msgstr "单击动画书底部栏中的**直方图**按钮（|直方图|）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:367
msgid ""
"Right-click the Flipbook content and choose **Show Histogram** from the menu "
"that opens."
msgstr "右键单击动画书内容，然后从打开的菜单中选择**显示直方图**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:369
msgid "Choose the channel for which you want to see the histogram."
msgstr "选择要查看直方图的通道。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:371
msgid "**To define the previewed images background color:**"
msgstr "**要定义预览图像的背景颜色，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:373
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:385
msgid "Choose Xsheet  →  **Scene Settings...**"
msgstr "选择Xsheet→  **场景设置。..**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:375
msgid "Set the **Camera BG Color** by doing one of the following:"
msgstr "通过执行以下操作之一设置**相机BG颜色**："

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:377
msgid "Set the **Red**, **Green** and **Blue** values."
msgstr "设置**红色**、**绿色**和**蓝色**值。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:379
msgid ""
"Click the *color thumbnail* and use the Style Editor to edit it (see  :ref:"
"`Plain Colors <plain_colors>`  )."
msgstr ""
"单击*颜色缩略图*，然后使用样式编辑器对其进行编辑（请参阅：ref:`Plain "
"Colors<Plain_Colors>`）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:381
msgid ""
"This color is relevant only in the Preview window and when the Viewer is in "
"*Preview mode*."
msgstr "此颜色仅在预览窗口中以及查看器处于*预览模式*时相关。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:383
msgid "**To define the Flipbook checkerboard colors:**"
msgstr "**要定义动画书棋盘颜色，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:387
msgid ""
"Set the **Checkerboard Color 1** and **Color 2** by doing one of the following:"
msgstr "通过执行以下操作之一设置**棋盘颜色1**和**颜色2**："

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:389
msgid "Set the Red, Green and Blue values."
msgstr "设置红色、绿色和蓝色值。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:391
msgid ""
"Click the color thumbnail and use the Style Editor to edit it (see  :ref:`Plain "
"Colors <plain_colors>`  )."
msgstr ""
"单击颜色缩略图，然后使用样式编辑器对其进行编辑（请参阅：ref:`纯色"
"<Plain_Colors>`）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:397
msgid "Using the Playback Markers"
msgstr "使用播放标记"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:398
msgid ""
"Two markers, **Playback Start Marker** and **Playback End Marker**, are "
"available in the frame column of the Xsheet (and the frame row of the Timeline) "
"to define the playback range."
msgstr ""
"Xsheet的帧列（和时间线的帧行）中有两个标记，**播放开始标记**和**播放结束标记**，"
"用于定义播放范围。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:400
msgid ""
"The user can manually set the playback markers to define the *starting* and "
"*ending* frames to be considered when playing back the animation, or leave them "
"unset, so OpenToonz automatically defines a playback range that includes all of "
"the Xsheet/Timeline contents."
msgstr ""
"用户可以手动设置播放标记，以定义播放动画时要考虑的*开始*和*结束*帧，也可以不设置"
"它们，因此OpenToonz会自动定义一个包含所有Xsheet/Timeline内容的播放范围。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:402
msgid ""
"When the playback markers are activated, the frame range in the **Preview "
"Settings...** dialog changes accordingly (see  :ref:`Using the Preview Window "
"<using_the_preview_window>`  )."
msgstr ""
"当播放标记被激活时，**预览设置中的帧范围。..**对话框会相应地更改（请参阅："
"ref:“使用预览窗口<Using_the_Preview_Window>”）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:404
msgid "**To set a playback range:**"
msgstr "**要设置播放范围，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:406
msgid "Set the starting frame by doing one of the following:"
msgstr "通过执行以下操作之一设置起始帧："

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:408
msgid "Drag the **Playback Start Marker** to the desired frame."
msgstr "将**播放开始标记**拖动到所需的帧。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:410
msgid ""
"Right-click on the desired frame in the frame column/bar and select **Set Start "
"Marker** from the menu that shows."
msgstr "在帧列/栏中右键单击所需的帧，然后从显示的菜单中选择**设置开始标记**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:412
msgid "Set the ending frame by doing one of the following:"
msgstr "通过执行以下操作之一设置结束帧："

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:414
msgid "Drag the **Playback End Marker** to the desired frame."
msgstr "将**播放结束标记**拖动到所需的帧。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:416
msgid ""
"Right-click on the desired frame in the frame column and select **Set Stop "
"Marker** from the menu that shows."
msgstr "右键单击帧列中所需的帧，然后从显示的菜单中选择**设置停止标记**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:418
msgid ""
"**To set the playback range to match the duration of a block of contiguous "
"exposed cells:**"
msgstr "**要设置播放范围以匹配连续暴露单元格块的持续时间，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:420
msgid ""
"In the Xsheet/Timeline, select an exposed cell from the desired column/layer."
msgstr "在Xsheet/Timeline中，从所需的列/层中选择一个暴露的单元格。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:422
msgid ""
"Right-click on the desired frame in the frame column and select **Set Auto "
"Markers** from the menu that shows."
msgstr "在帧列中的所需帧上单击鼠标右键，然后从显示的菜单中选择**设置自动标记**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:424
msgid ""
"There must be an exposed cell in that column/layer at that frame for the **Set "
"Auto Markers** option to be available."
msgstr "在该帧的该列/层中必须有一个暴露的单元格，才能使用**设置自动标记**选项。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:426
msgid ""
"No matter to what block of contiguous exposed cells the selected cell belongs "
"to, this function will take into account the frame in which the user performed "
"the right click operation to set the markers."
msgstr ""
"无论所选单元格属于哪个连续的暴露单元格块，此函数都会考虑用户执行右键单击操作以设"
"置标记的帧。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:428
msgid "**To set a single-frame playback range:**"
msgstr "**要设置单帧播放范围，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:430
msgid ""
"Right-click on the desired frame in the frame column/bar and select **Preview "
"This** from the menu that shows."
msgstr "在框架列/栏中右键单击所需的框架，然后从显示的菜单中选择**预览此**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:432
msgid "**To unset the playback markers:**"
msgstr "**要取消设置播放标记，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:434
msgid ""
"Right click on the frame column and select **Remove Markers** from the menu "
"that shows."
msgstr "右键单击框架列，然后从显示的菜单中选择**删除标记**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:436
msgid "When deactivated, playback markers turn *grey*."
msgstr "停用后，播放标记将变为*灰色*。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:441
msgid "Rendering the Animation"
msgstr "渲染动画"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:442
msgid ""
"Final animations can be rendered directly by loading the related scene, or in "
"batch mode. In both cases the rendering properties are defined in the Output "
"Settings dialog."
msgstr ""
"最终动画可以通过加载相关场景或以批处理模式直接渲染。在这两种情况下，渲染属性都"
"在“输出设置”对话框中定义。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:444
msgid ""
"Information about the scene name and frame number can be included when needed "
"in rendered frames by activating the **Show Info in Rendered Frames** option in "
"the Preferences...  →  General dialog section."
msgstr ""
"通过激活“首选项”中的“在渲染帧中显示信息”**选项，可以在需要时将有关场景名称和帧号"
"的信息包含在渲染帧内。..  →  常规对话框se"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:450
msgid "Choosing the Output Settings"
msgstr "选择输出设置"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:451
msgid ""
"The Output Settings dialog lets you define the file format, location and "
"properties for the final rendering. Settings are the following:"
msgstr "“输出设置”对话框允许您定义最终渲染的文件格式、位置和属性。设置如下："

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:453
msgid "|output_settings_dialog|"
msgstr "|输出设置对话框|"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:458
msgid "Camera Settings"
msgstr "相机设置"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:460
msgid ""
"**Output Camera:** sets which camera, among the ones defined in the scene, has "
"to be used to render the animation."
msgstr "**输出摄影机：**设置场景中定义的摄影机中必须用于渲染动画的摄影机。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:462
msgid ""
"**Frame Size** sets the frame size of the current camera, also available in the "
"Xsheet  →  **Camera Settings...** dialog (see  :ref:`Defining Camera Settings "
"<defining_camera_settings>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**Frame Size**设置当前相机的帧大小，也可在Xsheet中使用→  **相机设置。..**对话框"
"（请参阅：ref:`定义相机设置<Defining_Camera_Settings>`）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:464
msgid ""
"**Frame Start:** and **End:** set the frame range of the scene to render; by "
"default these values refer to the whole scene length."
msgstr ""
"**帧开始：**和**结束：**设置要渲染的场景的帧范围；默认情况下，这些值指的是整个场"
"景的长度。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:466
msgid ""
"**Step:** sets the step for the rendered sequence; for example if it is 2, one "
"frame each two will be rendered."
msgstr "**步骤：**设置渲染序列的步骤；例如，如果它是2，则每两帧渲染一帧。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:468
msgid ""
"**Shrink:** sets a reduction value for the defined render resolution; for "
"example if it is 2, one pixel each two will be rendered, thus resulting in "
"frames having half of the original output camera resolution."
msgstr ""
"**收缩：**为定义的渲染分辨率设置缩减值；例如，如果它是2，则每两个像素将渲染一个"
"像素，从而导致帧具有原始输出相机分辨率的一半。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:473
msgid "File Settings"
msgstr "文件设置"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:475
msgid ""
"**Save in:** is for setting the location where the output is saved; the "
"location can be set by typing or by using the Browser button."
msgstr ""
"**保存位置：**用于设置输出保存的位置；可以通过键入或使用浏览器按钮来设置位置。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:477
msgid ""
"If in the Browser you choose any default folder of the active project, in the "
"path field the full path will be replaced by the related default folder alias "
"(see  :ref:`Project Default Folders <project_default_folders>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**保存位置：**用于设置输出保存的位置；可以通过键入或使用浏览器按钮来设置位置。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:479
msgid ""
"**Name:** is the name you want to assign to the output file; by default it's "
"the name of the scene."
msgstr "**名称：**是您要分配给输出文件的名称；默认情况下，它是场景的名称。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:481
msgid ""
"In case the chosen file format produces image sequences, the base name will be "
"assigned to all rendered frames, that will be identified by a progressive four-"
"digits number written between the *base name* and the *file extension*, e.g. "
"``animation.0001.tif`` , ``animation.0002.tif`` , etc. These file sequences "
"will be displayed in the OpenToonz File Browser with a double dot before the "
"file extension, e.g. ``animation..tif`` , and treated as a single animation "
"level when loaded back into OpenToonz."
msgstr ""
"如果所选文件格式产生图像序列，则将为所有渲染帧分配基本名称，该名称将由写在*基本"
"名称*和*文件扩展名*之间的递增四位数标识，例如“animation.0001."
"tif”、“animation-0002.tif”等。这些文件序列将在OpenToonz文件浏览器中显示，文件扩"
"展名前有一个双点，例如“”动画。.tif，并在加载回OpenToonz时被视为单个动画级别。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:483
msgid ""
"**File Format** is the format for the output; natively supported formats are "
"the following: 3GP, AVI, BMP, GIF, JPG, MOV, NOL, PNG, RGB, SGI, Spritesheet, "
"TGA, TIF and TIFF."
msgstr ""
"**文件格式**是输出的格式；本机支持的格式如下：3GP、AVI、BMP、GIF、JPG、MOV、"
"NOL、PNG、RGB、SGI、Spritesheet、TGA、TIF和TIFF。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:485
msgid ""
"OpenToonz supports the 3GP and MOV formats by using the 32-bit version of "
"QuickTime."
msgstr "OpenToonz通过使用32位版本的QuickTime支持3GP和MOV格式。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:487
msgid ""
"To save in other popular video formats, like MP4 and WebM, OpenToonz uses "
"FFmpeg (a free software project that produces libraries and programs for "
"handling multimedia data). Once FFmpeg is installed in the system, and "
"configured to work with OpenToonz, MP4 and WebM will be listed along the other "
"standard output file formats. For detailed instructions on how to install and "
"configure FFmpeg, please see  :ref:`Using FFmpeg with OpenToonz "
"<using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz>`  ."
msgstr ""
"为了保存为其他流行的视频格式，如MP4和WebM，OpenToonz使用FFmpeg（一个生成处理多媒"
"体数据的库和程序的自由软件项目）。一旦FFmpeg安装在系统中，并配置为与OpenToonz一"
"起使用，MP4和WebM将与其他标准输出文件格式一起列出。有关如何安装和配置FFmpeg的详"
"细说明，请参阅：ref:`在OpenToonz中使用FFmpeg<Using _FFmpeg_with_OpenToonz>`。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:489
msgid ""
"Apart from 3GP, AVI, GIF, MOV, MP4 and WebM, all other formats will output "
"image sequences."
msgstr "除了3GP、AVI、GIF、MOV、MP4和WebM，所有其他格式都将输出图像序列。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:491
msgid ""
"**Options** button, opens a dialog to set specific properties related to the "
"chosen file format, such as codecs for video files, color depth for TIF images, "
"etc."
msgstr ""
"**选项**按钮，打开一个对话框，设置与所选文件格式相关的特定属性，如视频文件的编解"
"码器、TIF图像的颜色深度等。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:493
msgid ""
"**Resample Balance:** controls the resample that is used when images are scaled "
"or rotated. In scenes where images are strongly resampled, for instance when "
"their size changes dramatically, the final rendering may appear slightly out of "
"focus. By chosing a different resampling algorithm you can give some sharpness "
"back to the rendered frames."
msgstr ""
"**重采样平衡：**控制图像缩放或旋转时使用的重采样。在图像被强烈重采样的场景中，例"
"如当它们的大小发生巨大变化时，最终渲染可能会出现轻微失焦。通过选择不同的重采样算"
"法，您可以为渲染帧提供一些锐度。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:495
msgid ""
"There are several options to choose from. Originally Toonz provided only three "
"options: **Standard**, **Improved**, and **High**. The higher the balance "
"chosen, the longer the time needed for rendering the output. Currently "
"OpenToonz also provides several other standard resampling options that could "
"help improve the final results in a wider range of situations. These include: "
"**Triange filter**, **Mitchell-Netravali filter**, **Cubic convolution**, "
"**Hann window**, **Hamming window**, **Lanczos window**, **Gaussian "
"convolution**, **Closest Pixel** and **Bilinear**."
msgstr ""
"有几个选项可供选择。最初，Toonz只提供了三个选项：**标准**、**改进**和**高**。选"
"择的平衡值越高，渲染输出所需的时间就越长。目前，OpenToonz还提供了其他几种标准重"
"采样选项，可以在更广泛的情况下帮助改善最终结果。这些包括：**三角滤波器**、"
"**Mitchell Netravali滤波器**、***三次卷积**、**Hann窗**、**汉明窗**、**Lanczos窗"
"**、***高斯卷积**、***最近像素**和**双线性**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:497
msgid ""
"**Channel Width:** sets the color depth for rendered images; choices are **8 "
"bit** and **16 bit** per color channel. If using the 16 bit channel width, be "
"sure to select an output file format supporting it, for example the **TIF** "
"format with the **64(RGBA)** option activated."
msgstr ""
"**通道宽度：**设置渲染图像的颜色深度；每个颜色通道可选择**8位**和**16位**。如果"
"使用16位通道宽度，请务必选择支持它的输出文件格式，例如激活**64（RGBA）**选项的"
"**TIF**格式。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:499
msgid ""
"**Dedicated CPUs:** sets, in case your computer has multiple CPUs, how many "
"processor threads will be assigned to the rendering process. Setting the value "
"to **All** will generate a number of rendering threads equal to the number of "
"processors, thus speeding up the rendering process. However in systems with "
"limited RAM resources, it's suggested to use the **Half** or **Single** options "
"if the scene to render is very complex, because the higher the dedicated CPUs, "
"the more RAM will be required to perform the rendering, leading to potentially "
"longer rendering times or system instability."
msgstr ""
"**专用CPU：**设置，如果您的计算机有多个CPU，将为渲染进程分配多少处理器线程。将该"
"值设置为**All**将生成与处理器数量相等的渲染线程数量，从而加快渲染过程。然而，在"
"RAM资源有限的系统中，如果要渲染的场景非常复杂，建议使用**半**或**单**选项，因为"
"专用CPU越高，执行渲染所需的RAM就越多，这可能会导致渲染时间延长或系统不稳定。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:501
msgid ""
"**Render Tile:** allows the rendering of complex scenes, by dividing each frame "
"in a certain number of *tiles*, which are individually rendered and finally "
"stitched together to create the final output frame: the smaller the size of the "
"tiles, the longer the rendering will take but the less RAM will require. "
"Setting the value to **Medium** or **Small** will allow the rendering of very "
"high resolution outputs of very complex scenes, that otherwise may fail to be "
"rendered; setting the value to **None** may prevent some artifacts that the "
"tile stitching may generate. In most cases the **Large** value will do the "
"work, because it's not slower than the **None** option, and yet is able to "
"render complex scenes."
msgstr ""
"**渲染图块：**允许渲染复杂场景，通过将每一帧划分为一定数量的*图块*，这些图块被单"
"独渲染并最终拼接在一起以创建最终输出帧：图块的大小越小，渲染所需的时间就越长，但"
"所需的RAM就越少。将该值设置为**中**或**小**将允许渲染非常复杂场景的非常高分辨率"
"的输出，否则可能无法渲染；将该值设置为**无**可以防止拼贴拼接可能产生的一些伪影。"
"在大多数情况下，**Large**值会起作用，因为它不会比**None**选项慢，但能够渲染复杂"
"的场景。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:506
msgid "Other Settings"
msgstr "其他设置"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:508
msgid ""
"**Add Clapperboard** allows to add a Clapperboard. A clapperboard is a static "
"image intended to display information of the scene. It will be added before the "
"rendered frames, in order to record and convey information to subsequent phases "
"of the pipeline."
msgstr ""
"**Add Clapper board**允许添加一个Clapper board。拍板是一种静态图像，用于显示场景"
"的信息。它将被添加到渲染帧之前，以便记录信息并将其传达给管道的后续阶段。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:510
msgid ""
"For this option to be enabled you must first choose any video file format from "
"the **File Format** dropdown menu (i.e. 3GP, AVI, MOV, MP4 or WebM)."
msgstr ""
"要启用此选项，您必须首先从**文件格式**下拉菜单中选择任何视频文件格式（即3GP、"
"AVI、MOV、MP4或WebM）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:512
msgid ""
"**Edit Clapperboard...** button, opens a dialog for designing the clapperboard "
"and setting its properties. For detailed information on using the Clapperboard "
"feature, please see the  :ref:`Using The Clapperboard "
"<using_the_clapperboard>`  section."
msgstr ""
"**编辑隔板。..**按钮，打开一个对话框，用于设计拍手板并设置其属性。有关使用"
"Clapper board功能的详细信息，请参阅：ref:“使用Clapper "
"board<using_the_clairboard>”部分。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:514
msgid ""
"**Gamma:** performs a gamma correction on rendered images before writing them "
"to a file; the value you specify can include decimal fractions."
msgstr ""
"**Gamma：**在将渲染图像写入文件之前，对其执行伽马校正；您指定的值可以包含小数。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:516
msgid ""
"**Dominant Field:** allows you to render two images per frame, then keeping "
"only *odd* lines from one image, and *even* lines from the other to compose a "
"final frame. This process is called *interlacing*."
msgstr ""
"**主场：**允许您每帧渲染两个图像，然后只保留一个图像的*奇数*行，另一个图像中的*"
"偶数*行，以组成最后一帧。这个过程被称为*交错*。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:518
msgid ""
"*Interlaced* images are useful when experiencing a strobe effect due to a fast "
"camera or object movement, as all movement interpolation will be effectively "
"doubled (having one *odd-lines image* and one *even-lines image*, instead of "
"just one full *progresive* frame), thus becoming smoother."
msgstr ""
"*当因相机或物体快速移动而产生频闪效果时，交错*图像非常有用，因为所有运动插值都将"
"有效地加倍（具有一个*奇数行图像*和一个*偶数行图像*，而不仅仅是一个完整的*渐进*"
"帧），从而变得更平滑。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:520
msgid ""
"Field rendering is only relevant for scenes that are intended for video output. "
"Options are **None** (for rendering *progresive* frames), **Even (PAL)** and "
"**Odd (NTSC)** (for chosing which of the rendered *interlaced* fields is to be "
"shown in first place). Usually you should choose it according to the video "
"standard you are outputting to."
msgstr ""
"场渲染仅适用于用于视频输出的场景。选项有**无**（用于渲染*逐行扫描*帧）、**偶数"
"（PAL）**和**奇数（NTSC）**（用于选择首先显示哪个渲染的*隔行扫描*场）。通常，您"
"应该根据要输出的视频标准来选择它。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:522
msgid ""
"**Frame Rate**: is the frame rate of the scene, also available in the Xsheet  "
"→  **Scene Settings...** dialog (see  :ref:`Setting the Frame Rate "
"<setting_the_frame_rate>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**帧率**：是场景的帧率，也可在Xsheet中获得→  **场景设置。..**对话框（请参阅："
"ref:`设置帧率<Setting_the_Frame_Rate>`）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:524
msgid ""
"**Stretch from FPS:  To:** changes the timing of the Xsheet when outputting "
"files; in this way you can output a number of frames that is independent from "
"the frame rate set in the scene settings."
msgstr ""
"**从FPS拉伸：到：**更改输出文件时Xsheet的时间；通过这种方式，您可以输出与场景设"
"置中设置的帧速率无关的多个帧。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:526
msgid ""
"For example, if you are working at 25 fps, a 150 frames Xsheet will produce 6 "
"seconds of animation. If you need to transfer the frame rate to 30 fps using "
"the same Xsheet, the animation will last 5 seconds (150 frames divided by 30 "
"fps is equal to 5 seconds), and consequently it will be a little bit faster. "
"Stretching from 25 to 30 fps, the output will include an increased number of "
"frames to retain the original time length, and the rendered frames will be 180 "
"(6 seconds multiplied by 30 fps is equal to 180 frames)."
msgstr ""
"例如，如果你以每秒25帧的速度工作，150帧的Xsheet将产生6秒的动画。如果需要使用相同"
"的Xsheet将帧率转换为30fps，动画将持续5秒（150帧除以30fps等于5秒），因此速度会快"
"一点。从25 fps扩展到30 fps，输出将包括更多的帧数以保持原始时间长度，渲染的帧数将"
"为180（6秒乘以30 fps等于180帧）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:528
msgid ""
"When going from a higher frame rate to a lower one, some level drawings will "
"not be used because the number of output frames decreases. When doing the "
"contrary, some level drawings will be repeated because the number of output "
"frames is higher. Interpolations for object movements and special effects "
"variations will be re-computed according to the final frame rate, in order to "
"keep all the interpolations as smooth as possible."
msgstr ""
"当从较高的帧速率切换到较低的帧速率时，由于输出帧数减少，某些级别的图形将不会被使"
"用。当执行相反的操作时，由于输出帧数较高，某些级别的绘图将被重复。对象运动和特效"
"变化的插值将根据最终帧率重新计算，以保持所有插值尽可能平滑。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:530
msgid ""
"When the field rendering is used (by using the **Dominant Field** option) and "
"the **Stretch** feature is set for passing from a lower frame rate to a higher "
"one, drawings and images *will be interlaced* as well, to create newly added "
"frames."
msgstr ""
"当使用场渲染（通过使用**主导场**选项）并且将**拉伸**功能设置为从较低的帧速率传递"
"到较高的帧速率时，图形和图像*也将交错*，以创建新添加的帧。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:532
msgid ""
"The **Particles** effect may have unexpected results when the scene is "
"stretched to a higher FPS value, as the effect requires the original timing "
"information."
msgstr ""
"当场景拉伸到更高的FPS值时，**粒子**效果可能会产生意想不到的结果，因为该效果需要"
"原始计时信息。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:534
msgid ""
"**Multiple Rendering:** creates automatically for a single scene several output "
"files based on the Xsheet columns (or Timeline layers) content, and according "
"to the FX Schematic. Options are **None**, **FX Schematic Flows** and **FX "
"Schematic Terminal Nodes** (see  :ref:`Creating Multiple Renderings "
"<creating_multiple_renderings>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**多重渲染：**根据Xsheet列（或时间线层）内容和FX原理图，为单个场景自动创建多个输"
"出文件。选项有**无**、**FX原理图流**和**FX原理图示终端节点**（请参阅：ref:“创建"
"多个渲染<Creating_Multiple_rendering>”）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:536
msgid ""
"**Do stereoscopy** activates the stereoscopic 3D output of the scenes. Each "
"frame will be rendered from two different camera view creating two sequences of "
"files, one for each view. The suffixes **_l** (left) and **_r** (right) will be "
"used to identify sequences."
msgstr ""
"**Do stereoscopy**激活场景的立体3D输出。每一帧将从两个不同的相机视图渲染，创建两"
"个文件序列，每个视图一个。后缀**_l**（左）和**_r**（右）将用于标识序列。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:538
msgid "**Camera Shift:** sets the distance between the two camera views."
msgstr "**相机偏移：**设置两个相机视图之间的距离。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:540
msgid ""
"For working properly at least some elements of the scene must have **Z-Depth** "
"values other than 0 in their positioning. OpenToonz uses these values and the "
"**Camera Shift** parameter for rendering the stereoscopic effect."
msgstr ""
"为了正常工作，场景中至少有一些元素的位置必须具有**Z-Depth**值，而不是0。"
"OpenToonz使用这些值和**Camera Shift**参数来渲染立体效果。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:542
msgid ""
"**Render** button, starts rendering the scene using the current render settings."
msgstr "**“渲染**”按钮，使用当前渲染设置开始渲染场景。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:544
msgid "**To set the scene output settings:**"
msgstr "**要设置场景输出设置，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:546
msgid "Choose Render  →  ***Output Settings...**"
msgstr "选择渲染→  ***输出设置。..**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:548
msgid "Set the options you want to use for the final rendering."
msgstr "设置要用于最终渲染的选项。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:554
msgid "Using The Clapperboard"
msgstr "使用隔板"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:555
msgid ""
"A clapperboard is a static image intended to display information of the scene. "
"It will be added before the rendered frames, in order to record and convey "
"information to subsequent phases of the pipeline."
msgstr ""
"拍板是一种静态图像，用于显示场景的信息。它将被添加到渲染帧之前，以便记录信息并将"
"其传达给管道的后续阶段。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:557
msgid "|clapperboard|"
msgstr "|拍手板|"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:559
msgid ""
"The clapperboard consists of board *items*. At the bottom-right of the "
"Clapperboard Settings dialog there is a list of all the clapperboard items, "
"which can be layered by moving them **Up** or **Down** in the list by using the "
"appropriate buttons. Items can also be created or deleted by using the **Add** "
"or **Remove** buttons."
msgstr ""
"拍手板由板*个项目*组成。在“拍板设置”对话框的右下角，有一个所有拍板项目的列表，可"
"以通过使用相应的按钮在列表中移动**向上**或**向下**来对其进行分层。还可以使用**添"
"加**或**删除**按钮创建或删除项目。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:563
msgid ""
"Settings for the *currently selected* item are displayed above the items list, "
"at the top-right of the Clapperboard Settings dialog. Each item has an "
"information **Type:**. Most of them will automatically retrieve the "
"correspondent data from the current scene or the system, such as: scene "
"**Duration**, **Scene location**, **Current date**, etc. Other types, such as "
"**Text** or **Image** allow to input user defined data to be displayed in the "
"Clapperboard."
msgstr ""
"*当前选定*项目的设置显示在“隔板设置”对话框右上角的项目列表上方。每个项目都有一个"
"信息**类型：**。它们中的大多数会自动从当前场景或系统中检索相应的数据，例如：场景"
"**持续时间**、**场景位置**、**当前日期**等。其他类型，如**文本**或**图像**，允许"
"输入用户定义的数据以在Clapper板中显示。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:567
msgid ""
"The settings can be saved as a *Preset* in order to be reused later, using the "
"**Save as Preset** and **Load Preset** buttons. They can also be stored in the "
"project's default settings by using the File  →  **Save Default Settings** "
"command."
msgstr ""
"使用**另存为预设**和**加载预设**按钮，可以将设置另存为*预设*，以便以后重复使用。"
"也可以使用文件将它们存储在项目的默认设置中→  **保存默认设置**命令。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:570
msgid ""
"WARNING: Adding the Clapperboard will make the scene file to lose compatibility "
"with older versions of OpenToonz. Setting the **Duration:** back to 0 will "
"remove the clapperboard data from the scene, so that compatibility can be "
"restored."
msgstr ""
"警告：添加Clapperboard将使场景文件与旧版本的OpenToonz失去兼容性。将**持续时间："
"**设置回0将从场景中删除拍手板数据，以便恢复兼容性。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:572
msgid "**To Add a Clapperboard:**"
msgstr "**要添加隔板，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:574
msgid "Open the Render  →  Output Settings... dialog."
msgstr "打开渲染→  输出设置。..对话框。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:576
msgid "Select any *movie* type file format (3GP, AVI, MOV, MP4 or WebM)."
msgstr "选择任何*电影*类型的文件格式（3GP、AVI、MOV、MP4或WebM）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:578
msgid "In the More Settings section, enable the **Add Clapperboard** option."
msgstr "在“更多设置”部分，启用**添加隔板**选项。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:580
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:596
msgid ""
"Click **Edit Clapperboard...** button. The **Clapperboard Settings** dialog "
"opens."
msgstr "单击**编辑隔板。..**按钮。**隔板设置**对话框打开。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:582
msgid "Set the **Duration (frames):** option to any value greater than 0."
msgstr "将**持续时间（帧）：**选项设置为大于0的任何值。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:584
msgid ""
"Setting the duration to 0 frames will remove the clapperboard data from the "
"scene when it's saved."
msgstr "将持续时间设置为0帧将在保存时从场景中删除拍板数据。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:586
msgid "**To temporarily deactivate the Clapperboard:**"
msgstr "**要暂时停用Clapperboard，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:588
#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:594
msgid "Open the Render  →  Output Settings...  →  More dialog section."
msgstr "打开渲染→  输出设置。..  →  更多对话部分。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:590
msgid "Disable the **Add Clapperboard** option."
msgstr "禁用**添加隔板**选项。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:592
msgid "**To Delete the Clapperboard:**"
msgstr "**要删除隔板：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:598
msgid "Set the **Duration (frames):** option value to 0."
msgstr "将**持续时间（帧）：**选项值设置为0。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:600
msgid "Save the scene."
msgstr "保存场景"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:606
msgid "Creating Multiple Renderings"
msgstr "创建多个渲染"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:607
msgid ""
"With **Multiple Rendering:** it's possible to render automatically, from a "
"single scene, several output files based on the Xsheet columns (or Timeline "
"layers) content and according to the FX Schematic. Options are **None**, **FX "
"Schematic Flows** and **FX Schematic Terminal Nodes**."
msgstr ""
"使用**多重渲染：**可以根据Xsheet列（或时间线层）内容和FX原理图从单个场景自动渲染"
"多个输出文件。选项有**无**、**FX原理图流程**和**FX原理图示终端节点**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:609
msgid ""
"**Flows**: creates as many outputs as the **flows connecting the column nodes "
"to the Xsheet node**. Any effect nodes with multiple input ports met along the "
"flow (such as Matte effects) will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"**流**：创建与将列节点连接到Xsheet节点**的**流一样多的输出。沿流遇到的具有多个输"
"入端口的任何效果节点（如无光泽效果）都将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:611
msgid ""
"**Terminal Nodes**: creates as many outputs as the **number of nodes linked to "
"the Xsheet node**; all the columns and effects linked to each of these nodes "
"will be taken into account for the rendering."
msgstr ""
"**终端节点**：创建与链接到Xsheet节点**的节点数量一样多的输出；渲染时将考虑链接到"
"每个节点的所有列和效果。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:613
msgid ""
"The names of the different output files are automatically generated in order to "
"avoid any name conflict between file names. In particular they are built by "
"appending to the *output file name*: the **column name**, then the **column "
"ID** (as can be read in the node tooltip), then the **effect name**, then the "
"**effect ID** (as can be read in the node tooltip) *in case the effect node was "
"renamed*. For example ``scene01_B(Col3)_My Blur(Blur1)..tif``  is one of the "
"output files of the scene *scene01* , related to the flow going from column *B* "
"(whose ID is *Col3*) to the effect node *My Blur* (whose ID is *Blur1*)."
msgstr ""
"不同输出文件的名称是自动生成的，以避免文件名之间的任何名称冲突。特别是，如果效果"
"节点被重命名，它们是通过在*输出文件名*后附加以下内容来构建的：**列名**，然后是**"
"列ID**（可以在节点工具提示中读取），然后是***效果名称**，最后是**效果ID**（可在"
"节点工具提示中阅读）*。例如“scene01_B（Col3）_My模糊（Blur1）”。.tif是场景"
"*scene01*的输出文件之一，与从列*B*（其ID为*Col3*）到效果节点*My Blur*（其ID为"
"*Blur1*）的流有关。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:615
msgid ""
"No output will be displayed after the rendering, regardless of **Open Flipbook "
"after Rendering** being activated in Preferences...  →  Preview dialog section."
msgstr ""
"无论在“首选项”中激活**“渲染后打开动画书”**，渲染后都不会显示任何输出。..  →  预"
"览对话框部分。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:617
msgid ""
"If you need more control on the way scene elements are rendered, you may "
"consider using Sub-Xsheets and the **Over** effect (see  :ref:`Using Sub-"
"Xsheets <using_sub-xsheets>`  and  :ref:`Over <over>`  ). For example if you "
"want a single output for a set of columns/layers, you may collapse them in a "
"Sub-Xsheet (in case of **Flows** type multiple rendering) or connect them to "
"several Over nodes (in case of **Terminal Nodes** type multiple rendering)."
msgstr ""
"如果您需要对场景元素的渲染方式进行更多控制，可以考虑使用Sub Xsheets和**Over**效"
"果（请参阅：ref:“使用Sub Xseets<using Sub-Xsheets>”和：ref:` Over<Over>”）。例"
"如，如果你想为一组列/层提供一个输出，你可以在子X表中折叠它们（在**Flows**类型的"
"多重渲染的情况下），或者将它们连接到多个Over节点（在**终端节点**类型的多元渲染的"
"情况中）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:623
msgid "Rendering Animations with Alpha Channel Information"
msgstr "使用Alpha通道信息渲染动画"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:624
msgid ""
"It's possible to render a scene with a transparent background color in order to "
"export it to editing systems supporting alpha channel information."
msgstr ""
"可以渲染具有透明背景颜色的场景，以便将其导出到支持阿尔法通道信息的编辑系统。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:626
msgid ""
"In this case no image has to be used as background, and the output file format "
"has to support alpha channel information, e.g. TIF at 32 or 64 bits per pixel, "
"TGA at 32 bits per pixel, or MOV with codecs supporting alpha (i.e. Animation)."
msgstr ""
"在这种情况下，不必使用图像作为背景，输出文件格式必须支持阿尔法通道信息，例如每像"
"素32或64位的TIF、每像素32位的TGA或具有支持阿尔法的编解码器的MOV（即动画）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:628
msgid "**To render animation with alpha channel information:**"
msgstr "**要使用alpha通道信息渲染动画，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:630
msgid "Choose Xsheet  →  **Scene Settings...**."
msgstr "选择Xsheet→  **场景设置。..**."

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:632
msgid "Set the alpha channel of the **Camera BG Color** to 0 (i.e. transparent)."
msgstr "将**相机BG颜色**的alpha通道设置为0（即透明）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:634
msgid "Choose an output file format supporting alpha channel information."
msgstr "选择支持alpha通道信息的输出文件格式。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:640
msgid "Rendering A Loaded Scene"
msgstr "渲染加载的场景"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:641
msgid ""
"The current scene can be rendered directly while being loaded in OpenToonz "
"according to the defined Output Settings."
msgstr "根据定义的输出设置，当前场景可以在OpenToonz中加载时直接渲染。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:643
msgid ""
"By choosing the appropriate range in the Output Settings it's possible to "
"render the scene in chunks, for example by rendering a section first, and then "
"another one. In this case the animation available in the Output location will "
"always include all frames rendered up to that point, both if the format is a "
"multiple-files output (e.g. TIF or TGA), and a single-file one (e.g. MP4 or "
"MOV). The same applies if a section of the scene has to be rendered again "
"because some corrections were needed."
msgstr ""
"通过在“输出设置”中选择适当的范围，可以按块渲染场景，例如先渲染一个部分，然后渲染"
"另一个部分。在这种情况下，输出位置中可用的动画将始终包括到那时为止渲染的所有帧，"
"无论是多文件输出（如TIF或TGA）还是单文件输出（例如MP4或MOV）。如果由于需要进行一"
"些校正而必须再次渲染场景的一部分，则情况也是如此。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:645
msgid ""
"If the scene contains some audio files and is rendered in a file format "
"supporting audio (for example MP4), all the audio files will be merged to form "
"the soundtrack of the movie (see  :ref:`Creating a Soundtrack "
"<creating_a_soundtrack>`  )."
msgstr ""
"如果场景包含一些音频文件，并且以支持音频的文件格式（例如MP4）呈现，则所有音频文"
"件都将被合并以形成电影的配乐（请参阅：ref:`创建音轨<Creating_a_track>`）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:647
msgid ""
"Audio files loaded in Sub-Xsheets will not be included in the output soundtrack "
"(see  :ref:`Using Sub-Xsheets <using_sub-xsheets>`  )."
msgstr ""
"加载到Sub Xsheets中的音频文件将不会包含在输出音轨中（请参阅：ref:“使用Sub "
"Xsheets<Using_Sub-Xsheets>”）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:649
msgid ""
"As soon as the rendering is over, the rendered animation can be automatically "
"displayed in a OpenToonz Flipbook by activating the **Open Flipbook after "
"Rendering** option in the Preferences...  →  Preview dialog section; it's also "
"possible to display blank frames after each rendering playback when looping. If "
"a soundtrack is available for the rendered scene, it's also possible to listen "
"to it."
msgstr ""
"渲染结束后，通过激活首选项中的**渲染后打开动画书**选项，渲染的动画可以自动显示在"
"OpenToonz动画书中。..  →  预览对话框部分；循环时，也可以在每次渲染回放后显示空白"
"帧。如果渲染场景有可用的配乐，也可以听。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:651
msgid ""
"When displayed in the Flipbook, the rendering can be checked by using the "
"Flipbook tools (see  :ref:`Using the Flipbook <using_the_flipbook>`  )."
msgstr ""
"当在动画书中显示时，可以使用动画书工具检查渲染（请参阅：ref:“使用动画书"
"<using_the_Flipbook>”）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:653
msgid ""
"You can also activate the **Use Default Viewer for Movie Formats** option in "
"the Preferences...  →  General dialog section, in order to play back the output "
"with its own default viewer, e.g. QuickTime Player for the MOV format."
msgstr ""
"您还可以在“首选项”中激活**使用默认查看器的电影格式**选项。..  →  常规对话框部"
"分，以便使用自己的默认查看器播放输出，例如MOV格式的QuickTime Player。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:655
msgid "**To render the currently loaded scene:**"
msgstr "**要渲染当前加载的场景，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:657
msgid "Choose Render  →  **Render**."
msgstr "选择渲染→  **渲染**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:659
msgid "**To display blank frames after each rendering playback when looping:**"
msgstr "**要在循环时每次渲染播放后显示空白帧，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:661
msgid "Choose File  →  Preferences...  →  **Preview**."
msgstr "选择文件→  偏好。..  →  **预览**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:665
msgid ""
"In **Blank Frames:** set how many blank frames you want to be displayed after "
"each preview playback, when looping."
msgstr "在**空白帧中：**设置循环时每次预览播放后要显示多少空白帧。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:667
msgid "In **Blank Frames Color:** set the color for the blank frames."
msgstr "在**空白帧颜色中：**设置空白帧的颜色。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:673
msgid "Rendering Scenes in Batch Mode"
msgstr "在批处理模式下渲染场景"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:674
msgid ""
"The rendering of a scene can be added to a task list and performed in batch "
"mode, in order to run it in the background while you perform other work on your "
"computer."
msgstr ""
"场景的渲染可以添加到任务列表中并以批处理模式执行，以便在计算机上执行其他工作时在"
"后台运行。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:676
msgid ""
"*Render tasks* can be submitted from the OpenToonz Browser and can be managed "
"and executed in the Tasks pane, together with *Cleanup tasks* (see  :ref:"
"`Cleaning up Drawings in Batch Mode <cleaning_up_drawings_in_batch_mode>`  )."
msgstr ""
"*渲染任务*可以从OpenToonz浏览器提交，并可以在“任务”窗格中与*清理任务*一起管理和"
"执行（请参阅：ref:“在批处理模式下清理图形"
"<Cleaning_updrawings_in_Batch_Mode>”）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:678
msgid "|tasks_render|"
msgstr "|任务渲染器|"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:680
msgid ""
"The Tasks pane is divided into two sections: on the left there is the Task tree "
"where all of the *Render tasks* are displayed with a clapboard icon and all the "
"*Cleanup tasks* with a brush icon; on the right there is Information about the "
"task selected in the Task tree."
msgstr ""
"任务窗格分为两部分：左侧是任务树，其中所有*渲染任务*都用隔板图标显示，所有*清理"
"任务*都有画笔图标显示；右侧是关于任务树中所选任务的信息。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:682
msgid ""
"The Task list can be saved as TNZBAT files and loaded back later, in case you "
"want to manage it through different working sessions."
msgstr ""
"任务列表可以另存为TNZBAT文件，稍后可以重新加载，以防您想通过不同的工作会话进行管"
"理。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:684
msgid "**To Save a Task list:**"
msgstr "**要保存任务列表，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:688
msgid ""
"Click the **Save** (|save|) or the **Save As** (|save_as|) buttons in the top "
"bar of the Tasks pane."
msgstr "单击“任务”窗格顶部栏中的**保存**（|保存|）或**另存为**（|另存为|）按钮。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:690
msgid ""
"Right-click the **Tasks** item at the top of the list and choose **Save Task "
"List** or the **Save Task List As** from the menu that opens."
msgstr ""
"右键单击列表顶部的**任务**项，然后从打开的菜单中选择**保存任务列表**或**将任务列"
"表另存为**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:692
msgid "Use the Browser that opens to save the list."
msgstr "使用打开的浏览器保存列表。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:694
msgid "**To Load a Task list:**"
msgstr "**要加载任务列表，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:698
msgid "Click the **Load** (|load|) button in the top bar of the Tasks pane."
msgstr "单击“任务”窗格顶部栏中的**加载**（|Load|）按钮。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:700
msgid ""
"Right-click the **Tasks** item at the top of the list and choose **Load Task "
"List** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击列表顶部的**任务**项，然后从打开的菜单中选择**加载任务列表**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:702
msgid "Use the Browser that opens to retrieve and load a previously saved list."
msgstr "使用打开的浏览器检索和加载以前保存的列表。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:704
msgid "**To resize the Tasks pane sections:**"
msgstr "**要调整“任务”窗格部分的大小，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:708
msgid "Click and drag the separator to resize sections."
msgstr "单击并拖动分隔符以调整截面大小。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:710
msgid "Click and drag the separator toward the window border to hide a section."
msgstr "单击并将分隔符拖动到窗口边框以隐藏部分。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:712
msgid ""
"Click and drag the separator collapsed to the window border toward the window "
"center to display again the hidden section."
msgstr "单击并将折叠的分隔符向窗口中心拖动到窗口边界，以再次显示隐藏部分。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:718
msgid "Managing and Executing Render Tasks"
msgstr "管理和执行渲染任务"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:719
msgid ""
"When a *Render task* is selected in the tree, in the section on the right of "
"the Tasks pane task-related properties are displayed, some of which can be "
"edited to configure the task. Properties are the following:"
msgstr ""
"在树中选择“渲染任务”后，在“任务”窗格右侧的部分中会显示与任务相关的属性，其中一些"
"属性可以编辑以配置任务。属性如下："

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:721
msgid ""
"**Name** displays the task name; it can be edited to better identify the task."
msgstr "**Name**显示任务名称；可以对其进行编辑以更好地识别任务。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:723
msgid "**Status** shows if the task is: Waiting, Running, Completed or Failed."
msgstr "**状态**显示任务是：等待、运行、已完成还是失败。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:725
msgid ""
"**Command Line** displays the command line related to the task execution with "
"arguments and qualifiers."
msgstr "**命令行**显示与任务执行相关的命令行，包括参数和限定符。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:727
msgid "**Server** displays the computer that is running, or will run, the task."
msgstr "**服务器**显示正在运行或将要运行任务的计算机。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:729
msgid "**Submitted By** displays the *user* that submitted the task."
msgstr "**提交人**显示提交任务的*用户*。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:731
msgid ""
"**Submitted On** displays the *computer* from where the task was submitted."
msgstr "**提交日期**显示提交任务的*计算机*。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:733
msgid "**Submission Date** displays *when* the task was submitted."
msgstr "**提交日期**显示*任务提交的时间。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:735
msgid "**Start Date** displays when the task execution started."
msgstr "**开始日期**显示任务执行开始的时间。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:737
msgid "**Completion Date** displays when the task execution was completed."
msgstr "**完成日期**显示任务执行完成的时间。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:739
msgid "**Duration** displays how long the execution lasted."
msgstr "**持续时间**显示执行持续了多长时间。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:741
msgid "**Step Count** displays the number of frames rendered."
msgstr "**步数**显示渲染的帧数。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:743
msgid "**Failed Steps** displays the number of frames that failed to be rendered."
msgstr "**失败步骤**显示未能渲染的帧数。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:745
msgid "**Successful Steps** displays the number of frames successfully rendered."
msgstr "**成功步骤**显示成功渲染的帧数。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:747
msgid ""
"**Priority** sets the importance or urgency of the task: tasks with a higher "
"priority will be executed first. It can be edited to change the task priority."
msgstr ""
"**优先级**设置任务的重要性或紧迫性：优先级较高的任务将首先执行。可以编辑它以更改"
"任务优先级。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:749
msgid ""
"**Output** displays the location, name and extension of the rendered output; "
"this information comes from the scene output settings but can be edited here "
"before the rendering."
msgstr ""
"**输出**显示渲染输出的位置、名称和扩展名；此信息来自场景输出设置，但可以在渲染之"
"前在此处进行编辑。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:751
msgid ""
"**Frames Per Chunk** sets how the task is divided into sub-tasks in order to "
"distribute the rendering job in the render farm, one sub-task for each "
"computer. It can be edited to change the chunk size (see  :ref:`Using Chunks "
"when Rendering Tasks <using_chunks_when_rendering_tasks>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**Frames Per Chunk**设置如何将任务划分为子任务，以便在渲染场中分配渲染作业，每台"
"计算机一个子任务。可以对其进行编辑以更改块大小（请参阅：ref:“渲染任务时使用块"
"<Using _Chunks_when _Rendering_Tasks>”）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:753
msgid ""
"**From** and **To** set the scene frame range to render; this information comes "
"from the scene output settings but can be edited here before the rendering "
"(see  :ref:`Choosing the Output Settings <choosing_the_output_settings>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**从**和**到**设置要渲染的场景帧范围；此信息来自场景输出设置，但可以在渲染前在此"
"处进行编辑（请参阅：ref:“选择输出设置<Choosing_the_output_settings>”）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:755
msgid ""
"**Step** sets the step for the rendered sequence; this information comes from "
"the scene output settings but can be edited here before the rendering (see  :"
"ref:`Choosing the Output Settings <choosing_the_output_settings>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**Step**设置渲染序列的步骤；此信息来自场景输出设置，但可以在渲染前在此处进行编辑"
"（请参阅：ref:“选择输出设置<Choosing_the_output_settings>”）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:757
msgid ""
"**Shrink** sets the reduction value of the rendered sequence resolution; this "
"information comes from the scene output settings but can be edited here before "
"the rendering (see  :ref:`Choosing the Output Settings "
"<choosing_the_output_settings>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**Shrink**设置渲染序列分辨率的缩减值；此信息来自场景输出设置，但可以在渲染前在此"
"处进行编辑（请参阅：ref:“选择输出设置<Choosing_the_output_settings>”）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:759
msgid ""
"**Dedicated CPUs** sets how many processors are assigned to the rendering "
"process; this information comes from the scene output settings but can be "
"edited here before the rendering (see  :ref:`Choosing the Output Settings "
"<choosing_the_output_settings>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**专用CPU**设置分配给渲染进程的处理器数量；此信息来自场景输出设置，但可以在渲染"
"前在此处进行编辑（请参阅：ref:“选择输出设置<Choosing_the_output_settings>”）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:761
msgid ""
"**Render Tile** sets if the rendering has to be computed in tiles; this "
"information comes from the scene output settings but can be edited here before "
"the rendering (see  :ref:`Choosing the Output Settings "
"<choosing_the_output_settings>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**如果渲染必须在图块中计算，则设置渲染图块**；此信息来自场景输出设置，但可以在渲"
"染前在此处进行编辑（请参阅：ref:“选择输出设置<Choosing_the_output_settings>”）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:763
msgid ""
"**Dependencies** lets you set which of the other submitted tasks *have to be "
"successfully completed* before starting the current task execution: these tasks "
"can be added from the box on the right where all submitted tasks are displayed."
msgstr ""
"**依赖关系**允许您设置在开始当前任务执行之前，必须成功完成哪些其他提交的任务*："
"这些任务可以从显示所有提交任务的右侧框中添加。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:765
msgid "Task execution can be started and stopped from the task list."
msgstr "可以从任务列表中启动和停止任务执行。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:767
msgid ""
"When the tasks are executed, the icon color tells the status of the task "
"according to the following color code:"
msgstr "执行任务时，图标颜色根据以下颜色代码告诉任务的状态："

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:769
msgid "*Grey*, when the task is *waiting* or is not executed yet."
msgstr "*灰色*，表示任务正在*等待*或尚未执行。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:771
msgid "*Yellow*, when the task is *being executed*."
msgstr "*黄色*，表示任务正在执行*。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:773
msgid "*Green*, when the task is *successfully executed*."
msgstr "*绿色*，当任务*成功执行*时。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:775
msgid "*Orange*, when the task is *executed with some errors*."
msgstr "*橙色*，当任务*执行时出现一些错误*。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:777
msgid "*Red*, when the task *execution has failed*."
msgstr "*红色*，表示任务*执行失败*。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:779
msgid "**To Add scenes to render in the task list:**"
msgstr "**要在任务列表中添加要渲染的场景，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:783
msgid ""
"Click the **Add Render** button (|add_render|) in the top bar of the Tasks pane "
"and use the Browser to select a scene file."
msgstr ""
"单击“任务”窗格顶部栏中的**添加渲染**按钮（|Add_Render|），然后使用浏览器选择场景"
"文件。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:785
msgid ""
"Select the scenes in the OpenToonz Browser, then right-click any of them and "
"choose **Add As Render Task** from the menu that opens."
msgstr ""
"在OpenToonz浏览器中选择场景，然后右键单击其中任何一个场景，并从打开的菜单中选择"
"**添加为渲染任务**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:787
msgid "**To Configure the render task in the task list:**"
msgstr "**要在任务列表中配置渲染任务，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:789
msgid "Select a render task in the task list."
msgstr "在任务列表中选择渲染任务。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:791
msgid "Configure it by using the options available on the right of the list."
msgstr "使用列表右侧的可用选项进行配置。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:793
msgid "**To select tasks in the task list:**"
msgstr "**要在任务列表中选择任务，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:797
msgid "Click a task to select it."
msgstr "单击任务以选择它。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:799
msgid "Shift-click a task to extend the selection up to that task."
msgstr "按住Shift键并单击任务，将选择范围扩展到该任务。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:801
msgid ""
"Ctrl-click (PC) or Cmd-click (Mac) a task to add it to, or remove it from the "
"selection."
msgstr ""
"Ctrl键单击（PC）或Cmd键单击（Mac）任务以将其添加到选择中，或将其从选择中删除。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:803
msgid "**To Execute selected tasks:**"
msgstr "**要执行所选任务，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:807
msgid "Click the **Start** (|start|) button in the top bar of the Tasks pane."
msgstr "单击“任务”窗格顶部栏中的**开始**（|Start|）按钮。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:809
msgid ""
"Right-click any selected task icon and choose **Start** from the menu that "
"opens."
msgstr "右键单击任何选定的任务图标，然后从打开的菜单中选择**开始**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:811
msgid "**To Stop the execution of selected tasks:**"
msgstr "**要停止执行所选任务，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:815
msgid "Click the **Stop** (|stop|) button in the top bar of the Tasks pane."
msgstr "单击“任务”窗格顶部栏中的**停止**（|Stop|）按钮。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:817
msgid ""
"Right-click any selected task icon and choose **Stop** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击任何选定的任务图标，然后从打开的菜单中选择**停止**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:819
msgid "**To Remove selected tasks from the list:**"
msgstr "**要从列表中删除所选任务，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:823
msgid "Click the **Remove** (|remove|) button in the top bar of the Tasks pane."
msgstr "单击“任务”窗格顶部栏中的**删除**（|Remove|）按钮。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:825
msgid ""
"Right-click any selected task in the list and choose **Remove** from the menu "
"that opens."
msgstr "右键单击列表中的任何选定任务，然后从打开的菜单中选择**删除**。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:827
msgid "**To Add or Remove tasks from the Dependencies list:**"
msgstr "**要在“依赖关系”列表中添加或删除任务，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:831
msgid ""
"To Add a task to the dependencies list, select a task in the task list on the "
"right and click the **<< Add** button."
msgstr ""
"要将任务添加到依赖关系列表中，请在右侧的任务列表中选择一个任务，然后单击**<<添加"
"**按钮。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:833
msgid ""
"To Remove a task from the dependencies list, select a task in the dependencies "
"list on the left, and click the **Remove >>** button."
msgstr ""
"要从依赖列表中删除任务，请在左侧的依赖列表中选择一个任务，然后单击**删除>>**按"
"钮。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:839
msgid "Using Chunks when Rendering Tasks"
msgstr "渲染任务时使用块"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:840
msgid ""
"If you are using the OpenToonz render farm, it's possible to divide a task into "
"chunks so that each computer of the farm will render a section of the same "
"render task (see  :ref:`Using the Toonz Farm <using_the_toonz_farm>`  )."
msgstr ""
"如果您使用的是OpenToonz渲染场，则可以将任务划分为块，以便场中的每台计算机都将渲"
"染同一渲染任务的一部分（请参阅：ref:`使用Toonz场<using_the_Toonz_farm>`）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:842
msgid ""
"The default value for the chunk size (expressed in number of frames) can be set "
"using the **Render Task Chunk Size** in the Preferences...  →  General dialog "
"section. If the default value is higher than the duration (in frames) of the "
"submitted scene, the value will be automatically adjusted to be equal to the "
"duration of the scene."
msgstr ""
"块大小的默认值（以帧数表示）可以使用首选项中的**渲染任务块大小**进行设置。..  "
"→  常规对话框部分。如果默认值高于提交场景的持续时间（以帧为单位），则该值将自动"
"调整为等于场景的持续时长。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:844
msgid ""
"Once a task is submitted, it's possible to change the chunk size by editing the "
"related value in the task properties."
msgstr "提交任务后，可以通过编辑任务属性中的相关值来更改块大小。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:846
msgid ""
"When a task is divided into chunks, each chunk of the task is represented in "
"the task tree as a sub-task."
msgstr "当任务被划分为块时，任务的每个块在任务树中都表示为子任务。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:848
msgid ""
"Render tasks and sub-tasks will be distributed on the farm, one for each "
"computer, so that several tasks can be executed at the same time (see  :ref:"
"`Using the Toonz Farm <using_the_toonz_farm>`  )."
msgstr ""
"渲染任务和子任务将分布在农场上，每台计算机一个，这样就可以同时执行多个任务（请参"
"阅：ref:`使用Toanz农场<Using_the_Toonz_farm>`）。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:850
msgid ""
"If you are not using the OpenToonz render farm, dividing the task into chunks "
"is not only useless, but it slows down the rendering process as well. For this "
"reason it's suggested to use a high **Render Task Chunk Size** value (e.g. "
"1000) in the Preferences...  →  General dialog section."
msgstr ""
"如果您没有使用OpenToonz渲染场，将任务划分为块不仅没有用，而且还会减慢渲染过程。"
"因此，建议在“首选项”中使用高**渲染任务块大小**值（例如1000）。..  →  常规对话框"
"部分。"

#: ../../source/rendering_the_animation.rst:852
msgid ""
"Chunk size is relevant only when animations are rendered as image sequences "
"(for example in TIF or TGA formats)."
msgstr "只有当动画被渲染为图像序列（例如TIF或TGA格式）时，块大小才相关。"
